{
    "id": "task2",
    "chapterId": "ch_3",
    "title": "Form Validation with Real‑time Feedback",
    "description": "Create a registration form with live validation and submit handling using event modifiers.",
    "estimatedMinutes": 15,
    "problemStatement": "## Problem Statement\n\nBuild a registration form with the following fields:\n\n- **Username** (required, at least 3 characters)\n- **Email** (required, must contain '@' and '.')\n- **Password** (required, at least 6 characters)\n- **Confirm Password** (must match Password)\n\nRequirements:\n\n1. **Real‑time validation** – show error messages next to each field as the user types (use `@input` or `@change`).\n2. **Disable the submit button** until all fields are valid.\n3. **On submit**, prevent default form submission, display a success message (or log to console), and optionally reset the form.\n4. Use **event modifiers** (`@submit.prevent`) and **key modifiers** (e.g., allow Enter to submit when valid).\n5. **Styling**: highlight invalid fields with a red border; show error messages in red.\n\n**Bonus**: Add a reset button that clears the form and resets validation state.",
    "hints": [
        "Store form data in a reactive object: `form: { username, email, password, confirmPassword }`.",
        "Create computed properties for each validation rule.",
        "Use a computed `isFormValid` that returns true only if all fields are valid.",
        "For email validation, you can use a simple regex or just check for '@' and '.'.",
        "Use `:disabled` on the submit button to enable/disable."
    ],
    "expectedOutput": "A fully validated registration form with live feedback and proper submit/reset behavior.",
    "solutionCode": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <title>Registration Form</title>\n  <script src=\"https://unpkg.com/vue@3/dist/vue.global.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    .form-group { margin-bottom: 15px; }\n    label { display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; }\n    input { width: 100%; padding: 8px; box-sizing: border-box; }\n    .error { border: 1px solid red; }\n    .error-message { color: red; font-size: 0.9em; margin-top: 5px; }\n    button { padding: 8px 16px; margin-right: 10px; }\n    button:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; }\n    .success { color: green; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div id=\"app\">\n    <h1>Register</h1>\n    <form @submit.prevent=\"handleSubmit\" @reset.prevent=\"resetForm\">\n      <div class=\"form-group\">\n        <label>Username:</label>\n        <input v-model=\"form.username\" :class=\"{ error: usernameError }\" @input=\"clearSuccess\">\n        <div class=\"error-message\" v-if=\"usernameError\">{{ usernameError }}</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"form-group\">\n        <label>Email:</label>\n        <input v-model=\"form.email\" :class=\"{ error: emailError }\" @input=\"clearSuccess\">\n        <div class=\"error-message\" v-if=\"emailError\">{{ emailError }}</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"form-group\">\n        <label>Password:</label>\n        <input type=\"password\" v-model=\"form.password\" :class=\"{ error: passwordError }\" @input=\"clearSuccess\">\n        <div class=\"error-message\" v-if=\"passwordError\">{{ passwordError }}</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"form-group\">\n        <label>Confirm Password:</label>\n        <input type=\"password\" v-model=\"form.confirmPassword\" :class=\"{ error: confirmPasswordError }\" @input=\"clearSuccess\">\n        <div class=\"error-message\" v-if=\"confirmPasswordError\">{{ confirmPasswordError }}</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div>\n        <button type=\"submit\" :disabled=\"!isFormValid\">Register</button>\n        <button type=\"reset\">Reset</button>\n      </div>\n\n      <p v-if=\"successMessage\" class=\"success\">{{ successMessage }}</p>\n    </form>\n  </div>\n\n  <script>\n    const { createApp } = Vue;\n\n    createApp({\n      data() {\n        return {\n          form: {\n            username: '',\n            email: '',\n            password: '',\n            confirmPassword: ''\n          },\n          successMessage: ''\n        };\n      },\n      computed: {\n        usernameError() {\n          if (!this.form.username) return 'Username is required.';\n          if (this.form.username.length < 3) return 'Username must be at least 3 characters.';\n          return '';\n        },\n        emailError() {\n          if (!this.form.email) return 'Email is required.';\n          if (!this.form.email.includes('@') || !this.form.email.includes('.')) {\n            return 'Please enter a valid email address (e.g., name@domain.com).';\n          }\n          return '';\n        },\n        passwordError() {\n          if (!this.form.password) return 'Password is required.';\n          if (this.form.password.length < 6) return 'Password must be at least 6 characters.';\n          return '';\n        },\n        confirmPasswordError() {\n          if (!this.form.confirmPassword) return 'Please confirm your password.';\n          if (this.form.confirmPassword !== this.form.password) return 'Passwords do not match.';\n          return '';\n        },\n        isFormValid() {\n          return !this.usernameError && !this.emailError && !this.passwordError && !this.confirmPasswordError;\n        }\n      },\n      methods: {\n        handleSubmit() {\n          console.log('Form submitted:', this.form);\n          this.successMessage = 'Registration successful! 🎉';\n          // Optional: reset form after success\n          // this.resetForm();\n          setTimeout(() => { this.successMessage = ''; }, 3000);\n        },\n        resetForm() {\n          this.form = { username: '', email: '', password: '', confirmPassword: '' };\n          this.successMessage = '';\n        },\n        clearSuccess() {\n          this.successMessage = '';\n        }\n      }\n    }).mount('#app');\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>"
}